Always have a backup.

00:36:34.910 --> 00:36:38.110
So this is what it
was supposed to do.

00:36:38.110 --> 00:36:40.540
Live demos, you never know.

00:36:40.540 --> 00:36:42.640
So it's supposed to predict
Matplotlib in Pandas

00:36:42.640 --> 00:36:44.970
for this question.

00:36:44.970 --> 00:36:48.618
And then we have a question that
