00:37:03.742 --> 00:37:05.200
If we could, go
back to the slides.

00:37:07.880 --> 00:37:10.700
So I covered a lot of
different tools today.

00:37:10.700 --> 00:37:14.420
I just wanted to give a
summary of everything we built.

00:37:14.420 --> 00:37:16.910
We built a custom text
classification model

00:37:16.910 --> 00:37:19.940
using tf.keras.

00:37:19.940 --> 00:37:23.100
We deployed our model
on Cloud AI Platform.

00:37:23.100 --> 00:37:25.010
I should also mention
that I could have also

00:37:25.010 --> 00:37:28.220
deployed that SHAP code to AI
Platform using the custom code

00:37:28.220 --> 00:37:29.450
feature.

00:37:29.450 --> 00:37:32.220
But in this case, I decided
just to keep it super simple

00:37:32.220 --> 00:37:34.660
and do that part separately.

00:37:34.660 --> 00:37:36.480
We explained our
model output using

00:37:36.480 --> 00:37:39.130
SHAP to make sure that our
model was behaving in the way

00:37:39.130 --> 00:37:41.030
that we expected.

00:37:41.030 --> 00:37:43.750
And we kind of called AI
Platform with Cloud Functions.

